  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Iconic Air Max 95 silhouette fused with Total 90 detailing inspired by soccer culture\nMixed material upper features mesh, leather and synthetic leather for retro flavor\nDistinctive Air Max 95 wavy lines with bold color blocking\nTotal 90 branding and details connect pitch heritage to street style\nLace-up design with thick eyelets and protective overlays\nOversized visible Air unit nods to the original and provides lightweight cushioning\nDurable rubber outsole offers reliable traction\nThe Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Total 90 is imported.\nTwo icons collide in the Men's Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Total 90 Casual Shoes, where Air Max heritage meets the bold spirit of Y2K soccer style. This remix of the classic 95 brings in Total 90 flair with bold color blocking, layered textures, and those unmistakable hits of branding on the tongue, heel, insole, and that oversized Air unit. Whether you're a die-hard sneakerhead, a soccer superfan, or just love a good throwback, this pair brings all the energy of the Swoosh legacy straight to your rotation.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Total 90 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Burgundy Crush/Metallic Gold/Black/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='pad